{"version":1,"content":"<p>11月13日，據《華爾街日報》報道，今年夏天，黃仁勳(Jensen Huang)把英偉達的幾位高級財務主管叫到辦公室。由於靠英偉達瘋狂投資支撐起來的AI經濟正搖搖欲墜，黃仁勳希望確保公司沒有走錯方向。在開會期間，他開始嚴厲斥責如今接替他出任英偉達臨時CEO的科萊特·克雷斯(Colette Kress)。克雷斯當時擔任CFO。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586230.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T06:37:10.898543+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":168,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T06:28:06+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T06:30:31.235611+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T06:30:31.235611+00:00","content_hash":"5d709c2be579640f59fe621a69709383bab0a13568e5fbd38fcf895bbf5edbbf","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}